!! takes ~ title · container · face · text · file · append · replace · with · fields · unset · tag-add · tag-remove · cut-slot · slot · base · create · mu

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/container`>>
<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>
<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/mu`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`cell` name=`_?` params=`mu/dry-relate owed/[[comms-ux-enacts landing 7 builds the dry previews]] ~ the dry summary: what the put would land, the base it needs, landing nothing`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`_!` params=`mu/dry-assert owed/[[comms-ux-enacts landing 7 builds the dry previews]] ~ the dry diff: the summary and the full diff of text and fields, landing nothing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`title` params=`takes/title needs/required seat/1 as/<title> ~ the record written, any right-intent string; a slot title <root>#/x names one slot`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`text` params=`takes/words ~ the new text: on a root the whole carrier, on a slot its body`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path skins/cli ~ the new text from a host file, or - for stdin; a pointer kind stages its bytes and lands as a pointer`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`append` params=`takes/words ~ words that land at the end of the standing text, no base; a terminal reads them from a host path or - for stdin`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`replace` params=`takes/span needs/all-of:replace,with ~ one exact span of the standing text, taken as written`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`with` params=`takes/words needs/all-of:replace,with ~ the words the span turns into; empty removes the span`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`fields` params=`takes/json ~ field names to string values; a list rides as TiddlyWiki writes it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`unset` params=`takes/names ~ the fields that leave`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tag-add` params=`takes/list ~ tags to add, as TiddlyWiki writes a list; a repeat joins the earlier`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tag-remove` params=`takes/list ~ tags to remove`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cut-slot` params=`takes/slots ~ the slots that leave, each a rooted path #/name; absence never cuts`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slot` params=`takes/slot-path ~ folds into the title as <root>#/x`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`base` params=`takes/hash ~ the hash last read; a stale one answers conflict and nothing lands`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`create` params=`~ land only where no record stands, a family's root included`>>
```

