<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ wiki-unreached · conflict · exists · replace-absent · replace-ambiguous · base-from-skinny · base-from-partial · base-outside-span · cut-not-omitted · slot-malformed · slot-beside-fragment · family-carriage-derives · family-joins-by-text · family-gate-refused · stage-path-shape · tiddler-withheld · rendered-derives · seat-canon-reach · cross-face-write-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-unreached` params=`cure/[[engine.record.puts title/<title> recipe/default text/<words>]] ~ no wiki this face hosts or holds a share of answers the slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`conflict` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default]] ~ the record moved past the base; read again, merge, put with the live base`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`exists` params=`cure/[[engine.record.puts title/<title> recipe/default text/<words>]] ~ a record already stands there; drop create to patch it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`replace-absent` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default text]] ~ the span occurs nowhere in the standing text; read it and copy the span as written`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`replace-ambiguous` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default text]] ~ the span occurs more than once, the count named; widen it until it occurs once`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`base-from-skinny` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default all]] ~ a card's base patches fields alone; read fat before a text write`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`base-from-partial` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default meme all]] ~ a partial base guards its span alone; read the whole carrier before a whole write`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`base-outside-span` params=`~ the partial base names another span; read the slot this put writes`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cut-not-omitted` params=`~ a cut names a slot the new text still carries, or none that stands`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`slot-malformed` params=`cure/[[engine.record.puts title/<root> recipe/default slot/#/notes text/<words>]] ~ a slot path reads #/name or #/a/b, with no space, # or $`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`slot-beside-fragment` params=`~ the title already names a slot; drop slot, or name the root`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`family-carriage-derives` params=`~ a family's type and carriage fields derive from its text`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`family-joins-by-text` params=`~ a new slot joins through its parent's text`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`family-gate-refused` params=`~ the Confluence gate reads the text as no one carrier`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`stage-path-shape` params=`~ a title under the memory stage reads one or two lowercase, hyphen-joined path segments`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`tiddler-withheld` params=`~ the title stays home: temp, state, a control or secret home, cap/**`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rendered-derives` params=`~ only the renderer writes a rendered tiddler; edit its source records`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`seat-canon-reach` params=`~ a seat reaches house canon through a recipe's copy-up and meme_offer, never a canon bag`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cross-face-write-refused` params=`~ a put writes the face it wears; target names a face to read`>>
```

